  "body": "- Expansive 19sqm east-facing front deck, plus 2nd side deck\r\n- Designer kitchen with hidden butler's pantry\r\n- Two securely allocated car parks and generous visitor car parking\r\n- Plenty of storage in the home along with a storage unit in the car park\r\n- Architecturally striking curved walls adding style and character\r\n\r\nStep into a residence where elegance meets effortless coastal living. Positioned in a prime location, this exceptional apartment is bathed in natural light and designed to capture breathtaking views across Long Bay Regional Park and the sparkling ocean beyond. From the moment you enter, you'll feel a sense of calm sophistication, where thoughtful design and premium finishes create a truly luxurious retreat.\r\n\r\nOther Features Include:\r\n- Wake up to spectacular sunrises\r\n- Sweeping views of Long Bay Regional Park and ocean\r\n- Corner apartment offering abundant sunlight\r\n- Three spacious bedrooms plus a versatile study\r\n- Custom shutters in main bedroom and electric blinds throughout\r\n- Seamless open plan kitchen, lounge, and dining area\r\n- Double ovens for effortless entertaining\r\n- Fully tiled bathrooms with premium finishes\r\n- Family bathroom complete with both bath and shower\r\n- Separate laundry\r\n- Sub-tropical gardens throughout complex - resort feel\r\n- Members lounge with spectacular views and full kitchen\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in an unbeatable location, you're just a short stroll to Long Bay Village, Long Bay Beach, scenic walking tracks, New World, and BestStart Long Bay. Set within a welcoming, family-friendly community and in zone for Long Bay College, Long Bay Primary School, and Northcross Intermediate, this is a rare opportunity to secure a lifestyle as impressive as the home itself.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/B71Z",
